WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.711
The final activity combines the major ideas from
Module 2 Choose

00:00:05.737 --> 00:00:10.158
a familiar two-table domain such as rooms and
reservations customers and orders

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:15.795
or courses and registrations Define the purpose and
row grain of both

00:00:15.822 --> 00:00:21.558
tables before writing SQL Give each table a primary
key and connect

00:00:21.585 --> 00:00:25.982
them with one foreign key Add required columns with
NOT NULL and

00:00:26.008 --> 00:00:31.553
at least one CHECK constraint Insert valid sample
rows and confirm

00:00:31.579 --> 00:00:36.257
that they work If you are ready for more add a
protected

00:00:36.284 --> 00:00:40.192
natural key a third table or junction table a
deletion rule and

00:00:40.218 --> 00:00:45.918
an invalid-data test Work incrementally copy a small
known pattern

00:00:46.089 --> 00:00:49.273
rename it for your domain change one piece at a time
and

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:50.536
run after every change
